  "description": {
    "text": "A box of August 2008 with one booster pack from each of the first six Diamond & Pearl Series expansions, three coins and six cosmos holofoil promos found in no booster pack: Professor Rowan, Bebe's Search, Cynthia's Feelings and the first partners Turtwig, Chimchar and Piplup. The first partners had come out in May that year, one to a blister pack, at stores such as Meijer and Wal-Mart; POP Series 6 packs held only non-holo copies of them.",
